# Hardcharger releases up to 2.2.0 answer 404 at /chargewire and serve the protocol under its
# pre-rename root, announced by this name in their discovery document. e2e.sh and
# windows-real-release.ps1 fall back to it, so they still check those releases. The old spelling
# lives here and nowhere else. Plain KEY=value lines: sh sources this file, PowerShell parses it.
PRE_RENAME_ROOT=/warp
PRE_RENAME_PROTOCOL=warp-sql
